---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="zh-TW" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="徐紹鈞 Josh 的個人履歷網站，專注於跨領域專案執行、資訊技術、資訊安全、行銷企劃與社群營運。"
    />

    <title>徐紹鈞 Josh | 跨領域專案執行與資訊管理</title>
  </head>

  <body
    class="bg-[#fafafa] text-slate-900 font-sans
           max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 pt-4 pb-16
           selection:bg-indigo-100 selection:text-indigo-900"
  >

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav
      class="sticky top-0 z-50
             bg-[#fafafa]/80 backdrop-blur-xl
             py-4 mb-14
             border-b border-slate-200/60
             flex justify-between items-center"
    >
      <a
        href="#"
        class="font-bold tracking-tight hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors"
      >
        SHAO-CHUN.
      </a>

      <div class="flex gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
        <a href="#about" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">
          關於
        </a>

        <a href="#experience" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">
          經歷
        </a>

        <a href="#community" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">
          社群
        </a>

        <a href="#certificates" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">
          證照
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>


    <!-- Hero -->
    <header
      class="mb-20 flex flex-col-reverse sm:flex-row
             sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-10"
    >

      <div class="sm:w-[68%]">

        <!-- status -->
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2
                 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600
                 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100
                 rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-5"
        >
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span>
          Open to new opportunities
        </div>


        <!-- Name -->
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl
                 font-bold tracking-[-0.04em]
                 text-slate-950 leading-tight"
        >
          徐紹鈞
        </h1>


        <!-- Nickname -->
        <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div
            class="h-px w-8 bg-gradient-to-r
                   from-indigo-500 to-cyan-400"
          ></div>

          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
            你可以叫我
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">小徐</span>
            ，或是
            <span class="font-semibold text-indigo-600">Josh</span>.
          </p>
        </div>


        <!-- Positioning -->
        <p
          class="mt-7 text-sm sm:text-base
                 text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
        >
          跨領域專案執行
          <span class="mx-2 text-slate-300">/</span>
          資訊安全與網頁維護
          <span class="mx-2 text-slate-300">/</span>
          行銷企劃與社群營運
        </p>


        <p
          class="mt-5 text-slate-600
                 leading-7 text-sm sm:text-base"
        >
          我喜歡把想法真正變成可以運作的東西。
          從資訊技術、資訊安全，到行銷企劃與大型社群活動，
          我習慣在不同領域之間快速理解問題、整合資源，
          並將專案一步一步推進。
        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- Profile -->
      <div class="sm:w-[32%] flex sm:justify-end">

        <div class="relative">

          <!-- decorative background -->
          <div
            class="absolute -inset-3
                   rounded-full
                   bg-gradient-to-br
                   from-indigo-200
                   via-purple-100
                   to-cyan-100
                   blur-xl opacity-70"
          ></div>

          <img
            src="/profile.jpg"
            alt="徐紹鈞 Josh"
            class="relative
                   w-36 h-36
                   rounded-full object-cover
                   border-4 border-white
                   shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/60"
          />

        </div>

      </div>

    </header>


    <!-- Overview stats -->
    <section class="mb-20">

      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4
               border-y border-slate-200
               divide-x divide-slate-200"
      >

        <div class="py-6 px-4">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            4
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
            跨領域工作經歷
          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="py-6 px-4">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            100+
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
            國際學生行政管理
          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="py-6 px-4">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            5+
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
            社群與志工參與
          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="py-6 px-4">
          <div
            class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight
                   text-indigo-600"
          >
            3
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
            核心跨域方向
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- About -->
    <section id="about" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">

        <span
          class="text-xs font-mono
                 tracking-widest text-indigo-500"
        >
          01
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">
          關於我
        </h2>

        <div
          class="flex-1 h-px
                 bg-gradient-to-r
                 from-slate-300
                 to-transparent"
        ></div>

      </div>


      <div
        class="space-y-5
               text-slate-600
               leading-8
               text-sm sm:text-base"
      >

        <p>
          2026 年畢業於國立雲林科技大學。
          求學歷程從技職體系出發，
          為了尋求能與不同背景同儕交流思想的環境，
          一路探索並持續挑戰自己。
        </p>

        <p>
          我的學習並不只停留在課堂。
          從協助餐廳將資訊知識應用於營運，
          到參與資訊安全相關工作、
          國際語言學校行政與大型開源社群活動，
          我逐漸建立出跨領域溝通與專案執行的能力。
        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- Areas -->
      <div class="mt-10">

        <p
          class="text-xs uppercase
                 tracking-[0.18em]
                 text-slate-400 mb-5"
        >
          WHAT I DO
        </p>


        <div class="space-y-4">

          <div class="group">
            <div
              class="flex justify-between
                     items-center text-sm mb-2"
            >
              <span class="font-medium">
                Project & Operations
              </span>

              <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs">
                專案執行 / 行政管理
              </span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="h-[3px]
                     bg-slate-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden"
            >
              <div
                class="w-[88%] h-full
                       bg-gradient-to-r
                       from-indigo-500
                       to-violet-400
                       rounded-full"
              ></div>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div class="group">

            <div
              class="flex justify-between
                     items-center text-sm mb-2"
            >
              <span class="font-medium">
                Technology
              </span>

              <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs">
                資訊 / 資安 / Web
              </span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="h-[3px]
                     bg-slate-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden"
            >
              <div
                class="w-[78%] h-full
                       bg-gradient-to-r
                       from-indigo-500
                       to-cyan-400
                       rounded-full"
              ></div>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="group">

            <div
              class="flex justify-between
                     items-center text-sm mb-2"
            >
              <span class="font-medium">
                Marketing & Community
              </span>

              <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs">
                行銷 / 社群 / 活動
              </span>
            </div>

            <div
              class="h-[3px]
                     bg-slate-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden"
            >
              <div
                class="w-[84%] h-full
                       bg-gradient-to-r
                       from-violet-500
                       to-pink-400
                       rounded-full"
              ></div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

        <p class="mt-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
          * 上方線條為個人專業方向的視覺呈現，並非量化能力評分。
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Experience -->
    <section
      id="experience"
      class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24"
    >

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">

        <span
          class="text-xs font-mono
                 tracking-widest text-indigo-500"
        >
          02
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">
          工作經驗
        </h2>

        <div
          class="flex-1 h-px
                 bg-gradient-to-r
                 from-slate-300
                 to-transparent"
        ></div>

      </div>


      <!-- Timeline -->
      <div
        class="relative
               border-l border-slate-200
               ml-2 sm:ml-3"
      >

        <!-- Experience 1 -->
        <article
          class="relative
                 pl-7 sm:pl-10
                 pb-12"
        >

          <span
            class="absolute
                   -left-[5px] top-2
                   w-[9px] h-[9px]
                   rounded-full
                   bg-indigo-500
                   ring-4 ring-[#fafafa]"
          ></span>


          <div
            class="flex flex-col
                   sm:flex-row
                   sm:justify-between
                   gap-2"
          >

            <div>

              <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
                數位行銷與專案協作
              </h3>

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
                歡喜心集 / 花上雅整合行銷
              </p>

            </div>


            <span
              class="font-mono
                     text-xs text-slate-400
                     whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              2021/08 → 現在
            </span>

          </div>


          <ul
            class="mt-4 space-y-2
                   text-sm text-slate-600
                   leading-6"
          >

            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400">—</span>
              經營社群、規劃貼文主題並設計活動海報與宣傳素材。
            </li>

            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400">—</span>
              市場開發與顧客關係管理，並協助網站內容管理與維護。
            </li>

            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400">—</span>
              參與跨部門協作、影片錄製與廣告拍攝專案。
            </li>

          </ul>

        </article>


        <!-- Experience 2 -->
        <article
          class="relative
                 pl-7 sm:pl-10
                 pb-12"
        >

          <span
            class="absolute
                   -left-[5px] top-2
                   w-[9px] h-[9px]
                   rounded-full
                   bg-white
                   border-2 border-indigo-400
                   ring-4 ring-[#fafafa]"
          ></span>


          <div
            class="flex flex-col
                   sm:flex-row
                   sm:justify-between
                   gap-2"
          >

            <div>

              <h3 class="font-semibold">
                國際語言學校行政管理
              </h3>

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
                菲律賓宿霧 BTES 國際語言學校
              </p>

            </div>


            <span
              class="font-mono
                     text-xs text-slate-400
                     whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              2024/07 → 2025
            </span>

          </div>


          <ul
            class="mt-4 space-y-2
                   text-sm text-slate-600
                   leading-6"
          >

            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400">—</span>
              負責逾 100 位學生行政與生活事務。
            </li>

            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400">—</span>
              使用英語協助台灣同事、當地教師與學生溝通。
            </li>

            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400">—</span>
              管理學校小賣部進貨、庫存控制及現金流。
            </li>

          </ul>

        </article>


        <!-- Experience 3 -->
        <article
          class="relative
                 pl-7 sm:pl-10
                 pb-12"
        >

          <span
            class="absolute
                   -left-[5px] top-2
                   w-[9px] h-[9px]
                   rounded-full
                   bg-white
                   border-2 border-slate-300
                   ring-4 ring-[#fafafa]"
          ></span>


          <div
            class="flex flex-col
                   sm:flex-row
                   sm:justify-between
                   gap-2"
          >

            <div>

              <h3 class="font-semibold">
                資訊設備維護與設計
              </h3>

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
                海碩能源股份有限公司
              </p>

            </div>


            <span
              class="font-mono
                     text-xs text-slate-400
                     whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              2023/10 → 2024
            </span>

          </div>


          <p
            class="text-slate-600
                   text-sm mt-4
                   leading-6"
          >
            負責電腦設備基礎維護、信箱系統管理及網站內容調整；
            獨立完成公司名片設計並處理帳務請款。
          </p>

        </article>


        <!-- Experience 4 -->
        <article
          class="relative
                 pl-7 sm:pl-10"
        >

          <span
            class="absolute
                   -left-[5px] top-2
                   w-[9px] h-[9px]
                   rounded-full
                   bg-white
                   border-2 border-slate-300
                   ring-4 ring-[#fafafa]"
          ></span>


          <div
            class="flex flex-col
                   sm:flex-row
                   sm:justify-between
                   gap-2"
          >

            <div>

              <h3 class="font-semibold">
                資訊安全處 實習生
              </h3>

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
                永豐商業銀行
              </p>

            </div>


            <span
              class="font-mono
                     text-xs text-slate-400
                     whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              2023/03 → 2023
            </span>

          </div>


          <p
            class="text-slate-600
                   text-sm mt-4 leading-6"
          >
            負責 USB、藍芽、DLP 設備維運及社群媒體跳板機檢核。
          </p>

        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Community -->
    <section
      id="community"
      class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24"
    >

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">

        <span
          class="text-xs font-mono
                 tracking-widest text-indigo-500"
        >
          03
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">
          開源社群與志工服務
        </h2>

        <div
          class="flex-1 h-px
                 bg-gradient-to-r
                 from-slate-300
                 to-transparent"
        ></div>

      </div>


      <div class="divide-y divide-slate-100">

        <div
          class="py-4 flex
                 flex-col sm:flex-row
                 sm:justify-between
                 gap-2"
        >
          <div>
            <strong>COSCUP 開源人年會</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm ml-2">
              場務組長・人員調度與場地規劃
            </span>
          </div>

          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
            2021
          </span>
        </div>


        <div
          class="py-4 flex
                 flex-col sm:flex-row
                 sm:justify-between
                 gap-2"
        >
          <div>
            <strong>SITCON Camp</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm ml-2">
              隊輔組長 / 組員
            </span>
          </div>

          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
            2021 / 2025
          </span>
        </div>


        <div
          class="py-4 flex
                 flex-col sm:flex-row
                 sm:justify-between
                 gap-2"
        >
          <div>
            <strong>HITCON 台灣駭客年會</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm ml-2">
              場務組員
            </span>
          </div>

          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
            2021 — 2022
          </span>
        </div>


        <div
          class="py-4 flex
                 flex-col sm:flex-row
                 sm:justify-between
                 gap-2"
        >
          <div>
            <strong>萬芳醫院愛心餐盒活動</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm ml-2">
              協調、搬運與送餐
            </span>
          </div>

          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
            Volunteer
          </span>
        </div>


        <div
          class="py-4 flex
                 flex-col sm:flex-row
                 sm:justify-between
                 gap-2"
        >
          <div>
            <strong>台灣燈會在台北</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm ml-2">
              導覽解說與遊客服務
            </span>
          </div>

          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
            2023
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Certificates -->
    <section
      id="certificates"
      class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24"
    >

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">

        <span
          class="text-xs font-mono
                 tracking-widest text-indigo-500"
        >
          04
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">
          專業證照
        </h2>

        <div
          class="flex-1 h-px
                 bg-gradient-to-r
                 from-slate-300
                 to-transparent"
        ></div>

      </div>


      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">

        <span
          class="border border-slate-200
                 bg-white px-3 py-2
                 rounded-lg text-slate-600"
        >
          MOS 2016 · Word / Excel / PPT / Access
        </span>

        <span
          class="border border-slate-200
                 bg-white px-3 py-2
                 rounded-lg text-slate-600"
        >
          電腦軟體應用 · 乙 / 丙級
        </span>

        <span
          class="border border-slate-200
                 bg-white px-3 py-2
                 rounded-lg text-slate-600"
        >
          網頁設計 · 丙級
        </span>

        <span
          class="border border-slate-200
                 bg-white px-3 py-2
                 rounded-lg text-slate-600"
        >
          NCC 業餘無線電人員執照
        </span>

        <span
          class="border border-indigo-100
                 bg-indigo-50
                 px-3 py-2
                 rounded-lg text-indigo-700"
        >
          TQC+ 網頁設計 / 雲端技術 · 專業級
        </span>

        <span
          class="border border-indigo-100
                 bg-indigo-50
                 px-3 py-2
                 rounded-lg text-indigo-700"
        >
          TQC 專業行銷 / e-Office · 專業級
        </span>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer
      class="mt-28 pt-8
             border-t border-slate-200
             flex flex-col sm:flex-row
             justify-between gap-3
             text-xs text-slate-400"
    >

      <span>
        © 2026 徐紹鈞 · Josh Hsu
      </span>

      <span>
        Built with curiosity & experience.
      </span>

    </footer>

  </body>
</html>